--- /dev/null
+++ b/packaging/tebako/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Tebako builder adapter
+
+Hive's primary builder uses Tebako's single-executable `press` contract:
+
+```sh
+tebako press --root=<checkout> --entry-point=bin/hive \
+  --output=<build>/hive-<target> --Ruby=3.4.1
+```
+
+`scripts/build-release` is the replaceable boundary. A replacement builder may
+be selected with `HIVE_PACKAGER`, but it must create the same executable path
+and pass the packaged-binary and release-manifest contracts.
