+## [2026-07-24] Testing — portable background subprocess cleanup
+
+The concurrent TUI subprocess integration fixture now reports its own child PIDs through a test-only file instead of discovering them with `pgrep`. This preserves the process/reaper coverage on minimal tier-1 release hosts without adding procps as a test dependency. See [[testing]].
